    {"type": "cause", "text": "That jump came from vehicle electrical architecture and software development services for the Volkswagen joint venture, plus remarketing and repair and maintenance [P18][P27]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "New electric vehicles fell 12.5% and subtracted 10.5pp, leaving that product at 67.6% of revenue [D287][D288][D286]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating costs grew 6.9% against 8.4% revenue growth, so incremental operating margin was 264.7% [D258][D239][D265]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Diluted shares rose 17.1% while the net loss fell 23.2%, so EPS improved 34.5% to -$3.07 [D260][D241][D243][F57]."}
