  {"key": "margins", "title": "Margins and costs", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating margin of -66.5% is the window high but still far below the -129.4% median [F31][D325][D326]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "In FY2025 the gross margin gain of 26.8pp drove the 27.8pp operating-margin improvement, while SG&A cost 0.5pp [D252][D253][D269]."},
