    {"type": "cause", "text": "SG&A rose 9.9% on go-to-market expansion, higher payroll and stock-based bonus accruals [D257][P13]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Net margin trailed operating margin by 1.1pp, as a $186 million securities litigation settlement lifted other expense [D359][P10]."}
