    {"type": "cause", "text": "The operating outflow shrank because of a significant reduction in net loss [P4]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Capex rose 49.9% to $1,710 million, 31.7% of revenue and 2.18x D&A, on Normal Factory capacity expansion [D246][F71][D225][D228][P3]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Stock-based compensation was $741 million, 20.7% of the operating loss, so cash burn understates the economic cost [X56][D237]."}
  ]},
